# Containerized Infrastructure Health Monitoring & Automation

A Go-based CLI application for managing server inventories and monitoring TCP connectivity.

## Features
- Server inventory management through CLI commands.
- JSON-based data persistence.
- TCP connectivity and health checks.
- Server health statistics.
- Docker containerization.
- Scheduled health checks using Linux cron and shell scripting.

## Tech Stack
- Go
- Docker
- Linux
- TCP Networking
- JSON
- Shell Scripting

## Run Locally

```bash
go run . list
go run . health
go run . stats
```

## Build with Docker

```bash
docker build -t healthchecker .
docker run --rm healthchecker list
```

**Status:** Actively under development.
